mb the\nladder?", "originalText": "Q01 · How does an insight topic climb the\nladder?", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "kept_s-53d9af04c18b", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-3670aa427bb7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2150.0, "y": 3090.0, "width": 800.0, "height": 125.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-41696548c151", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1754579315, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2094985043, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "kept_s-fc572140efda"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-fc572140efda", "type": "text", "x": 2170.0, "y": 3107.5, "width": 730.8, "height": 84.375, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-41696548c151", "roundness": null, "seed": 44706549, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 483987019, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Board = data + Jobs + answers; the Prototype is its own\nwork Block; Job = pN x vM; Task = a question in the Job;\nRun = a partition.", "originalText": "Board = data + Jobs + answers; the Prototype is its own\nwork Block; Job = pN x vM; Task = a question in the Job;\nRun = a partition.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "kept_s-3670aa427bb7", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-fbddf4123e0c", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3000.0, "y": 3090.0, "width": 700.0, "height": 96.00000000000001, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,